    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "I had this happen to me on Metavoice when I was running on colab.\r\n\r\nI did the following and it worked for my case (referring to @yf225 and @malfet 's comment):\r\n(FYI, my main language is Javascript so a noob at Python.)\r\n1. had to first restart and install the modules from scratch as the error happened upon importing triton. So first disconnected and created a new session on Colab.\r\n2. After installing the modules and before running the model (which triggers import of triton) I checked if there is any instances of triton installed. I ran:\r\n`!pip list | grep triton`\r\nIt returned nothing meaning the triton import was failing as it was not installed.\r\n3. installed triton using:\r\n`!pip install triton`\r\nThis worked like a charm.\r\n\r\nThank you guys.",
